<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S FONTANELLI WINS 16TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S FONTANELLI WINS 16TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>DALMINE, Italy 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fabiano Fontanelli of Italy won the 158-km 16th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Monday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Italian Fabio Roscioli was second and his compatriot Alberto Volpi third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Ivan Gotti of Italy retained the overall lead.</p>
</text>
